{"id": "van-ness-transit-construction-timeline", "title": "Van Ness construction reached substantial completion three years after its original target", "seconds": 55.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "790cabeceb94ae7c", "words": 137, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A grand jury traced how long construction took on Van Ness Avenue.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.27, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "was", "Van", "Ness", "construction", "complete?"], "sub": "Bus rapid transit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.6, 0.99, 1.39, 1.59, 1.86, 2.54, 2.83, 2.98, 3.21, 3.49]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "October 2019 was the original projection for substantial completion.", "t0": 4.39, "t1": 8.72, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "jury", "kicker": "sf-civil-grand-jury", "text": "Original projection", "mark": "Original projection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.84, 1.34, 1.52, 1.65, 2.08, 2.66, 2.86, 3.54]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "By June 2021 the projected date had moved to January 2022.", "t0": 8.84, "t1": 13.59, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Substantial completion", "heading": "Original, revised and actual", "source": "status", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Original projection", "value": "October 2019"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "June 2021 projection", "value": "January 2022"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Recorded completion", "value": "October 2022"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.9, 1.59, 1.71, 2.24, 2.58, 2.75, 3.0, 3.11, 3.67, 4.02]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The later project report lists October 31, 2022 as the actual date.", "t0": 13.71, "t1": 19.16, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "status", "kicker": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "text": "October 31, 2022", "mark": "October 31, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.92, 1.35, 1.63, 2.1, 3.01, 3.43, 4.18, 4.41, 4.55, 5.03]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The original and actual milestones were 36 months apart.", "t0": 19.28, "t1": 23.25, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "36 months", "label": "Original to actual substantial completion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.72, 0.93, 1.41, 2.18, 2.38, 3.08, 3.42]}, {"scene": "causes", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The grand jury traced much of the delay to avoidable water and sewer replacement setbacks.", "t0": 23.47, "t1": 28.59, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "jury", "kicker": "sf-civil-grand-jury", "text": "Underground utilities", "mark": "Underground utilities"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.75, 1.13, 1.39, 1.48, 1.6, 1.97, 2.16, 2.72, 3.11, 3.32, 3.7, 4.33]}, {"scene": "causes", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It found that the utility risk lacked a mitigation strategy.", "t0": 28.71, "t1": 32.07, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Risk and mitigation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.42, 0.54, 0.67, 1.2, 1.6, 1.9, 1.97, 2.61]}, {"scene": "causes", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The transit agency partly disagreed, identifying avoidable and unavoidable causes.", "t0": 32.19, "t1": 37.31, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "sf-civil-grand-jury", "text": "Agency response", "mark": "Agency response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.58, 1.09, 1.5, 2.22, 2.91, 3.53, 3.76, 4.41]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Passengers were already using the dedicated lanes in April 2022.", "t0": 37.53, "t1": 41.82, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "opening", "kicker": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "text": "April 1, 2022", "mark": "April 1, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.77, 1.09, 1.38, 1.49, 2.11, 2.54, 2.73, 3.16, 3.52]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A later contract modification addressed global claims and listed the October completion date.", "t0": 41.94, "t1": 47.37, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mod", "kicker": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "text": "September 2023 modification", "mark": "September 2023 modification"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.52, 1.05, 1.81, 2.26, 2.71, 3.27, 3.47, 3.85, 3.98, 4.45, 5.03]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not allocate a dollar loss to all 36 months.", "t0": 47.49, "t1": 51.34, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Responsibility for each day", "Cost of delay"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.72, 0.94, 1.41, 1.49, 1.89, 2.26, 2.43, 2.66, 3.33]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 51.46, "t1": 54.07, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Two different milestones", "causes": "What led to the delay", "service": "The passenger timeline"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "timeline"}